---
title: SalesOrder State Machine
---
stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> PendingApproval : Sales creates order (assisted / offline submit)

    PendingApproval --> PendingAllocation : Admin/Operator approve (holds NO stock)
    PendingApproval --> Rejected : reject (reason required)
    PendingApproval --> Cancelled : cancel (Sales own / Admin / Operator)

    PendingAllocation --> Approved : daily allocation run approved (plan + prices)
    PendingAllocation --> Cancelled : cancel before run commitment
    PendingAllocation --> Rejected : reject

    Approved --> Picking : first warehouse QR pick scan
    Picking --> Issued : every warehouse portion issued at dispatch (F96)
    Issued --> Delivering : dispatched to retailer
    Delivering --> Delivered : retailer confirms full receipt of all portions

    Rejected --> [*]
    Cancelled --> [*]
    Delivered --> [*]
